# 本机保留历史、合同、预算、原始Git元数据
/local-only/*
!/local-only/README.md
# 第三方依赖、构建、缓存与运行时
**/node_modules/
**/.npm-cache/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.vinext/
**/.sites-runtime/
**/.wrangler*/
**/.openai/
**/.vite/
**/.vite-temp/
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
# 环境文件与个人设置；配置样例可提交
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/~$*
**/*.log
!/reports/path-optimization/*.log
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
# 历史审查中的全文提取，原件另有正式入口
**/first-party-text.txt
**/workspace-docx-text.json
**/external-docx-*.txt
**/audit/word-review/render-temp/
